  "title": {
    "rendered": "Relocation of our Athens branch to new and larger facilities."
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"141\">We are pleased to announce that on Monday, August 23, 2021, we relocated to new, larger facilities in the Industrial Area of Kifisia, Athens.</p>\n<p data-start=\"143\" data-end=\"228\">More specifically, you can now find us at:<br data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"188\" />11A Andrea Metaxa Street, 14564 Kifisia.</p>\n<p data-start=\"230\" data-end=\"268\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Our telephone numbers remain the same.</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>We are pleased to announce that on Monday, August 23, 2021, we relocated to new, larger facilities in the Industrial Area of Kifisia, Athens. More specifically, you can now find us at:11A Andrea Metaxa Street, 14564 Kifisia. Our telephone numbers remain the same.</p>\n",
